{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f387a80ac9de65958c81d6fdb9b3e062f089a367584df540dc74ba405bdf0985", "ja": "（紗代子達のフラメンコユニットが、大好評だ。\n今日はメンバーが、雑誌インタビューを受けている）", "zh": "（紗代子她们的弗拉门戈组合广受好评。今天成员们正在接受杂志采访）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "301e1b392730bd3c5d8e68f9206bfd7ffc4844b1becededa7bf4f8cf44aa7b58", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\nすみません、長引いてしまって……。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n不好意思，没想到会拖这么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "38097513cef017899182bc82adf1d632497bba4badc4d7aad44494a4770b510c", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。\n盛り上がったみたいで、なによりだよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。看起来气氛很热烈，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "36f1f1ac33ecda95835ca7841226ef280857246aa39e506dd7405cc63f360ccd", "ja": "い、いえ、そういうことじゃないんです!\n答えにくい質問ばっかりで、迷ってしまって……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的！\n净是些很难回答的问题，我都不知道该怎么说了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "5c529472c6dea139e71df59db33473b9c7a5b46abb36fa7dbb76c44518ecf709", "ja": "フラメンコの予習はばっちりだったのに。\n恋バナみたいな質問ばっかりだったんです……。", "zh": "明明已经把弗拉门戈预习得非常充分了。\n结果尽是些像恋爱话题一样的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "194920aff37027cf7958363de36b401de268417cf4f3237d78173cf9e8abb115", "ja": "せっかくフラメンコ単語帳とか作って、\n歴史も勉強してきたのに……うう。", "zh": "好不容易还特意做了弗拉门戈单词本，也把历史学习了一遍……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2a896f17e43662c1d693d8c1c613f590f059946e6d3736f2a151f1479a2ffdfd", "ja": "そうか……残念だったな。\nまあ恋バナの方が、話題にはなるだろうし……。", "zh": "这样啊……真遗憾。\n不过，聊恋爱话题确实更容易成为谈资……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "def9febfa99d31a632da6f4627a11a14ce90f1232c19d5db93769328589ac48f", "ja": "でも、好きな人は？とか、気になる人は？って\nずっと聞かれて……私、うまくごまかせなくて。", "zh": "可是，她们一直追问我“有没有喜欢的人？”“有没有在意的人？”……我实在没法好好蒙混过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1008_p", "source_sha256": "24d3b4f4401d555199484933fd6669c7fc8ee305255ba331b21f0655e51a5fe5", "ja": "えっ？　まさか……答えちゃったのか！？", "zh": "诶？难道说……你回答了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "e0a6943f1ec0f9bc38f8953e2ad6524adb79ada7acd1b414e09a2eea46862f8e", "ja": "あの……\n私のそばに素敵な人がいる、って言ったんです。", "zh": "那个……\n我说的是，我身边有一位很棒的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "33df9809f224752c3311df989cb9325ba52d83d79522582ef217d7d14fce1cb1", "ja": "いつも、いろんなきっかけやヒントをくれる人で。\n……とても尊敬できる、素敵な人です、って。", "zh": "是个总是会给我各种契机和启示的人。\n……是个非常值得尊敬的、很棒的人，我是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5ae9169885f7f3b74f0eb478d23b236a006e791a1015d5c8ebfeeee851f48e7f", "ja": "なるほど。\nえっと、それはつまり……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n呃，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "80b7c461424381978fbef9673d82846098a7cec86a7e8d590d7150600bcfbac5", "ja": "……はい。とりあえず、身近な人で……\n{$P$}のこと、思い浮かべて……。", "zh": "……好的。总之先试着想象一下……\n身边的人……也就是{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "0cd68be9d4d61a8a846195f042e3fde0eaea81c23f2d5e6339c6e3ab9b0bb4e0", "ja": "あっ！　すみません。勝手にこんなこと……。\nダメ、でしたか……？", "zh": "啊！对不起，擅自做这种事……没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1014_p", "source_sha256": "73e1f97129f67dd46702136ff089b13b9f91d59027f8961611e3fa98c6716a83", "ja": "いや、ダメじゃないよ。\n尊敬枠なら、アイドルとしても問題ないかな。", "zh": "不，没有不行哦。\n如果是当成尊敬的对象，作为偶像来说也没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "4e54d12877297be1fc2070aae8de9acd8a0cdf0afbcb8c4bbb8a2747b5e7e9ed", "ja": "うぅ、すみません……もっと上手にならなくちゃって\n思うんですけど。恋バナとかは、やっぱり苦手です。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起……我也觉得\n自己得做得更好才行。不过恋爱话题……果然还是很不擅长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d42ee002eff61957e409c0d057f9d01f639ed2f84e4fcd9ebd29266a1e20466e", "ja": "まあ、大丈夫だよ。\nそれも紗代子っていうアイドルの個性だから。", "zh": "哎，没事的。\n这也是作为偶像的纱代子的个性嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1017_p", "source_sha256": "16cb9cdc542449d008a281696b36f8d6631cfd02b7de4c36eb21091e08751c1d", "ja": "ただ、苦手っていうなら、\n次からそういう仕事は、なるべく断ろうか？", "zh": "不过，如果你实在不擅长的话，下次这类工作就尽量推掉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "f5c2c95c8d7936bd268aa7d881d206be97c8b5c0c44a4db44f7d0dc45d8aa90b", "ja": "あっ、いえ……大丈夫です！\n苦手なことも、少しずつ頑張りたいので。", "zh": "啊，不……没关系！\n虽然有不擅长的事，但我也想一点一点努力去克服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "ac0127391f07a7a1a9233913499e1af26668f6fbd17b674c0d562657d5b336c0", "ja": "私、絶対についていきますから！\nよろしくお願いしますね！　{$P$}！", "zh": "我一定会紧跟您的步伐的！\n请多关照！　{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0263_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2399c0467a59888ec1483f8fa75addac1cc0f08d66e26aad4111b839cbadafbd", "ja": "（紗代子はどこまでも前向きだ。これからも、尊敬して\nもらえるにふさわしいプロデュースを続けないとな！）", "zh": "（纱代子一直都这么积极向前。今后也得继续进行配得上她尊敬的制作工作才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
